## ✅ 4. Operationally Complete (Sufficient to execute work)

This is the hardest test — and you pass it.

**From the SEU alone, the system knows:**

* What is wrong / right (`Emotional_State_Band`)
* How urgent it is (`Priority_Tier`, `urgency_band`)
* What kind of action to bias (`recommended_stream_bias`)
* Whether things are improving or collapsing (`Pattern_Flow`)
* Which emotion is driving behavior (`emotional_driver`)
* Whether silence is dangerous (Dormant RF × ES3/ES4 logic)

No human needs to “read the comments again”.

**Key insight:**
This SEU is **action-sufficient**, not insight-sufficient.

**Verdict:** ✅ Pass

